                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "There are better ways to spend your time.\n\nYou run around a maze, racing against the clock to collect lemons and progress to the next level. Sometimes you find oranges that add a minute to the timer.\n\nFirst levels are not that hard, especially since you can jump on some of the bushes and start running on the maze walls, breaking the game and making it easier to find lemons that you might have missed (doesn't really work on level 2, but you can still easily get out of bounds). Got to level 6 and I'm pretty sure that it is either unbeatable or requires mapping/planning your route in advance to beat it as I only found 3 oranges on the whole map and it is huge.\n\nWhenever you run out of time you are put back into main menu with no level select or load option being present. \nAt this point I decided to stop, as I have no desire to get through most of the game again just to try to beat level 6.\n\n3/10",
